{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0112_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0112_story_07_title", "source_sha256": "93668c9a92996ef6cec24fb0f8cf2ea1968757bde6485e075edb1443f4ee53ca", "ja": "夜明けの星をつないで", "zh": "连结黎明星辰", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0112_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0112_story_07_synopsis", "source_sha256": "986a76ca67ebe17d9a1e83dd77ebafbd1573cc8ae34e489842e6e176c5c1574a", "ja": "プラネタリウムに併設されたカフェで、打ち\n上げを楽しむ一同。名物メニューを食べなが\nら、お喋りに花を咲かせるアイドル達を見守\nりながら、静かに感慨にふけるプロデューサ\nーなのだった。", "zh": "在天文馆附设的咖啡馆里，大家享受着庆功宴。\n偶像们一边品尝特色菜单，一边兴致勃勃地聊着天。\n制作人守望着这一幕，静静地沉浸在感慨之中。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0112_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0112_story_07_1000_p", "source_sha256": "f026fb588266c8322e922bc73310fe6ded07af0182e10da86e60b4988a1d6057", "ja": "（プラネタリウムのイベントは、大盛況で終わった。\n今日はプラネタリウム併設のカフェで、打ち上げだ！）", "zh": "（天象馆的活动圆满结束了。今天要在天象馆附设的咖啡馆开庆功会！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0112_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0112_story_07_1001_029umi", "source_sha256": "2e6148025cc2b26733850d224dcf862b902fcf28136cf7bbe4cbe766a2257b8a", "ja": "き、き、き……きたーっ！\n女子力てんこ盛りメニュー！", "zh": "来、来、来……来了——！\n满满都是少女力的菜单！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0112_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0112_story_07_1002_029umi", "source_sha256": "ed2f78048beb92c61e728e5e1be5bb57af75056bf294a415775b25d3c16638a3", "ja": "星型のトッピングシュガーを振りかけた\n『夜空のチョコレートケーキ』だって☆　カワイイ！", "zh": "听说这是撒上星形装饰糖的『夜空巧克力蛋糕』☆好可爱！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0112_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0112_story_07_1003_021mat", "source_sha256": "cdc8405de96ec3017c48a45a770bc50e0d2e484613e4acb314b5387fdfdda8b7", "ja": "お皿の上でお星さまがキラキラしていて、\nとっても、ろまんてぃっく！なのです。", "zh": "盘子上的小星星闪闪发光，真是太浪漫了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0112_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0112_story_07_1004_029umi", "source_sha256": "368be484877cd84a0dea337c0cb1321088272d8801adb84c80b91ab43daadd6e", "ja": "こっちは……クッキーの輪っかが乗った、\n『土星のドームショートケーキ』！", "zh": "这边是……放着饼干圈的，\n“土星穹顶鲜奶油蛋糕”！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0112_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0112_story_07_1005_008tak", "source_sha256": "6b203b06625718a25e627ec86f5c5c44a6cd0ec3e6f7884778da54622858be77", "ja": "土星を丸ごと……良いのでしょうか？", "zh": "将土星整个吃下……真的没关系吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0112_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0112_story_07_1006_029umi", "source_sha256": "facb7fa03634f1fda50f1c829913a543835a37e8c9fa561a7eeaaacdb4adc0a6", "ja": "そしてそしてっ！　宇宙雲を意識した、\n青い『バタフライピーの宇宙雲クリームソーダ』！", "zh": "还有还有！这杯蓝色的“以宇宙云为灵感的蝶豆花宇宙云奶油苏打”！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0112_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0112_story_07_1007_042miy", "source_sha256": "45a5234c0845f8cf2b16015f9f95add359aef2f17ca56a8927e63932e8aef70b", "ja": "なんだか、吸い込まれそうな青ですね～。\nどんな味がするんでしょう～？", "zh": "总觉得这蓝色都快把人吸进去了呢～。\n不知道会是什么味道呢～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0112_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0112_story_07_1008_029umi", "source_sha256": "58bd559b1b7fa51c30651ae321767a506427383c297e384cd58f2e4d7268fd1d", "ja": "最後にこれっ、私が頼んだメニュー！\n辛さ銀河系！　『ドッカンビッグバンカレー』！！", "zh": "最后是这个，我点的菜！\n辣度银河系！『大爆炸宇宙咖喱』！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0112_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0112_story_07_1009_p", "source_sha256": "dbe34d30da9f788a1311c430c30c683d8112f0caa6246e84b31893e46d875da0", "ja": "見てるだけなのに、辛さが目に染みてくる……。\n銀河系の辛さは、伊達じゃないな……。", "zh": "光是看着，辣味都快钻进眼睛里来了……\n银河系级别的辣，果然名不虚传……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0112_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0112_story_07_1010_029umi", "source_sha256": "122cf6432662d29d43c78102b657c08736725122c5feb8c0e77772325d65f734", "ja": "ん？　……あれ？\nなんか私の頼んだメニューだけ、女子力低すぎ！？", "zh": "嗯？……咦？\n怎么感觉就我点的菜，女子力太低了啊！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0112_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0112_story_07_1011_021mat", "source_sha256": "6bea32d160f4931688f456c9a8e3bd77da3cbe7cdfc0fe7862b9b35c9919f9e5", "ja": "それなら海美ちゃんも、きゅーと！で\nらぶりー！なメニューを追加するのです！", "zh": "那样的话，海美也要加上超——可爱又讨人喜欢的菜单才行！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0112_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0112_story_07_1012_042miy", "source_sha256": "91aeac8f4b67d59b859f9dcc26cc684258a0f686811dd31a88d06a49af2ce82f", "ja": "そうですね～。\nみんなで食べたら、あっという間ですよ～。", "zh": "是啊～  \n大家一起吃的话，一下子就能吃完了哦～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0112_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0112_story_07_1013_029umi", "source_sha256": "86f521a2cdbf656dd5274cfee205c3be1647518fcd6a8d06c0d6c8eb2e15ff41", "ja": "えっ、本当に！？\nいいの、{$P$}！", "zh": "诶，真的吗！？\n可以吗，{$P$}！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0112_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0112_story_07_1014_p", "source_sha256": "402e815f8bdc66d30b39f6fedc677478b4dbb7ce4bb674d20431fdf7c89ab300", "ja": "ああ。ちゃんと食べ切れるなら、いいぞ！", "zh": "嗯。只要你能好好吃完，就行！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0112_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0112_story_07_1015_029umi", "source_sha256": "f1f2a8476366e033798b0586fd2d1fb81a250e4ba10d179d21251696dc220461", "ja": "やったーっ！　じゃあじゃあ、私、\nパフェとか追加しちゃおうかな……？", "zh": "太好了！那我、要不要再加个芭菲……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0112_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0112_story_07_1016_008tak", "source_sha256": "cebd56ddcb457effc6f5c230428366c3f4c9c4680eddef4f1d55b31a18133b1c", "ja": "心配しなくても大丈夫ですよ、海美。\n残さず、皆でいただきましょう。", "zh": "不用担心，海美。\n我们大家一起把它们吃光吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0112_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0112_story_07_1017_029umi", "source_sha256": "5ec1dbee55f80f08f6e767242155926b7ee668443203ea7795fefe8a5fbd8f62", "ja": "うん！　それじゃ……すみません！　『星空パフェ』と\n『ブラックホールパンケーキ』追加お願いしまーす！", "zh": "嗯！那就……不好意思！麻烦再加一份“星空芭菲”和\n“黑洞松饼——”", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0112_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0112_story_07_1018_p", "source_sha256": "952a6c4f9d4422594f558496f3006caef48f684fcda5b5243ae622802e67ec09", "ja": "（カフェの割引券をもらっておいて正解だったな！）", "zh": "（拿到咖啡店的优惠券真是太好了！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0112_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0112_story_07_1020_029umi", "source_sha256": "bf5f5c3808d964eaf0c60d9ded906d3b229c918ffe1a00f8e3467a154a7f1ed7", "ja": "このカレー、すっごく辛いけど、おいしー！\nでもやっぱり、辛いーっ！", "zh": "这咖喱特别辣，不过好好吃！\n\n但果然还是好辣——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0112_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0112_story_07_1021_042miy", "source_sha256": "a2efa4bead7ec21807d6d168bd7175aa1c9d93fb027f59279951190182d9d382", "ja": "宇宙雲クリームソーダも、とってもおいしいですよ～。\nおじいちゃんとも、来ればよかったですな～。", "zh": "宇宙云冰淇淋汽水也非常好喝哦～。\n要是也和爷爷一起来就好了呢～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0112_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0112_story_07_1022_p", "source_sha256": "2861faa8d86ef6e235dc80a50fc763a9bc10d78ad69714877fab8ed5d842c34b", "ja": "そういえば、あの日はまつりの妹さんも\n観に来てたとかって聞いたけど、本当なのか？", "zh": "说起来，我听说那天连小祭的妹妹也来看了，是真的吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0112_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0112_story_07_1023_021mat", "source_sha256": "448bbf9dbd48a1e951839a6d834fc32e585a1e0c07871b8917072fbe04c41220", "ja": "そうなのです。偶然近くを通りかかったから、\nちょっとのぞいただけ、と本人は言っていたのです。", "zh": "是这样的。她说只是碰巧从附近路过，所以顺便来看了一眼而已。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0112_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0112_story_07_1024_021mat", "source_sha256": "3de5729158b639b735102731b4e3c185f3d0de82a503954c4b8f75d6c7a20854", "ja": "なので、姫に声も掛けずに帰ってしまったのです。\nつれないのですー。", "zh": "所以，都没跟公主打招呼就回去了。真冷淡呀——", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0112_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0112_story_07_1025_042miy", "source_sha256": "2ca4941eb150e7dfc2ea0070c7ab675d6c4a66df65bea0ddecad30eab98f3f7f", "ja": "まつりちゃんは、妹さんと仲がいいんですね～。\n私はひとりっこなので、うらやましいですよ～。", "zh": "玛茨莉和妹妹关系很好呢～  \n我是独生子女，所以真让人羡慕啊～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0112_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0112_story_07_1026_008tak", "source_sha256": "9764bb10eb82bf499a4e336a40654f68bbd7f80930e8833fc8e615d889cdc274", "ja": "海美の姉君は、海美によく似ていましたね。\n真、美しい女性でした。", "zh": "海美的姐姐和海美很像呢。确实是一位美丽的女性。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0112_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0112_story_07_1027_029umi", "source_sha256": "6ea0bd3b1a66660e3c2767095788104988147a73c340eb105dbf68d4333db16b", "ja": "そうかな？　えへへ♪\nたしかに、お姉ちゃんは美人だと思うけど……。", "zh": "是吗？嘿嘿♪\n不过，姐姐确实是个美人……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0112_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0112_story_07_1028_p", "source_sha256": "29319b4699dbf5a2e19a5efafc924b9385d2d69dcea67e36c7924d60540c9321", "ja": "海美、お姉さんからメールがきたんだって？\nなんて書いてあったんだ？", "zh": "海美，你姐姐给你发邮件了？\n上面写了些什么？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0112_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0112_story_07_1029_029umi", "source_sha256": "83c3c11cf65387a52161ae1a020849477024e3336494adeeb1e226c9759b6e57", "ja": "うん！　イベント楽しかったよって。\nプラネタリウムもライブも、最高だったって！", "zh": "嗯！她说活动很开心。\n还说天文馆和演唱会都棒极了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0112_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0112_story_07_1030_029umi", "source_sha256": "b812391701ee7c180b5d6f30811ec53a5dbbe2a4d7912a0f70a7ee6060a1edfe", "ja": "それからね……えへへ。『海美ちゃんには、\n素敵なお友達がたくさんいるね』って！", "zh": "然后呢……嘿嘿。还说“海美，你有好多很棒的朋友呢”！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0112_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0112_story_07_1031_029umi", "source_sha256": "cdc9bd5f1913965427f11b73990331636b062566dfbd81dbc6ca33a03aa5257f", "ja": "みんなのこと、いっぱいほめてもらって、\nなんだか、すっ……ごくうれしかったんだー！", "zh": "大家都被夸了好多，真……的特别开心——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0112_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0112_story_07_1032_008tak", "source_sha256": "8d067de3bd5ec526484371a91505d646ac820025cbc6121073987196e8e81b38", "ja": "そうなのですか？", "zh": "是这样吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0112_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0112_story_07_1033_029umi", "source_sha256": "4a27d089204b813836745ae654c3a98c292b394fd3c58a1f14844bef002ea9e7", "ja": "うん！　だって、お姉ちゃんの代わりはいないけど……\n劇場のみんなにも、代わりはいないからね♪", "zh": "嗯！因为虽然没有人能代替姐姐……但剧场的大家也同样无可替代嘛♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0112_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0112_story_07_1034_p", "source_sha256": "8a4f2172987fb798a82eceb3da7a8d14318418ae652c0dcccbe934b8a343ed85", "ja": "そうだな。お姉さんと同じように、\n仲間も一人一人が、かけがえのない存在だ。", "zh": "是啊。和姐姐一样，伙伴们每个人都是无可替代的存在。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0112_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0112_story_07_1035_008tak", "source_sha256": "997bb8cb07da6baf3b564a59ef2d21bf535525b82f875a80371155a799d992c6", "ja": "そうですね。……私も、今回は海美やまつり姫、\n美也に、たくさん助けられたと思います。", "zh": "是啊……这次我也觉得，受到了海美、茉莉公主和美也她们很多帮助。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0112_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0112_story_07_1036_029umi", "source_sha256": "93077f755e869f1cc17b1dde853d8d548c9d2fbf4a42ee56317ef9c0a70e65ae", "ja": "助けるなんて、そんな～。\nえへ、えへへへへ……。", "zh": "说什么帮忙不帮忙的，真是的～  \n诶嘿、诶嘿嘿嘿嘿……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0112_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0112_story_07_1037_029umi", "source_sha256": "99c9edba857c270eaa1d3fac4fbbf422b056e3de5090712382883a1114dfb9ba", "ja": "私、貴音さんのこと大好きっ！\nまつりんも美也も、{$P$}も！", "zh": "我超喜欢贵音姐！\n还有小祭、美也，还有{$P$}！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0112_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0112_story_07_1038_029umi", "source_sha256": "2dc9b3270efca6a67127c8057b684780ba35b30d53613f588a915857ea012ba7", "ja": "だから、みんなと一緒に歌えて楽しかった☆", "zh": "所以，能和大家一起唱歌，我很开心☆", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0112_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0112_story_07_1039_021mat", "source_sha256": "d9776779477a6296508695be4c22d77fb6efa28dfb54f8baa30a3e8db4f4c957", "ja": "姫もです♪", "zh": "公主也是呢♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0112_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0112_story_07_1040_042miy", "source_sha256": "e19e5a191d6ed496ca2f2a72ec423d45a6847b4a4186051f0a0acee70dfd0359", "ja": "私もです～。", "zh": "我也是～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0112_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0112_story_07_1041_008tak", "source_sha256": "dadb3109281915869741c8c1c895c974302779f4f1bd277ba7fc8c504607df8d", "ja": "海美、注文した星空ぱふぇが来ましたよ。\n残りのびっぐばんかれーは、どうしますか？", "zh": "海美，点的星空芭菲送来了。  \n剩下的大爆炸咖喱要怎么办呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0112_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0112_story_07_1042_021mat", "source_sha256": "db8aabcfcd93dab86a1de8d2ce71dc316361ddf5d170dd7c7b1fe73c5e0dc09f", "ja": "海美ちゃんがお腹いっぱいなら、\nあとはみんなで食べてしまうのです！", "zh": "如果海美吃饱了，\n那剩下的就由大家一起吃掉吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0112_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0112_story_07_1043_029umi", "source_sha256": "67521a8d5c9b43353b7aa9b415b55068214f7c4b100ca14a01a8f332983da419", "ja": "わぁっ、待って待って！\nおいしいから、もう少し食べるー！", "zh": "哇，等等等等！\n因为很好吃，我再吃一点——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0112_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0112_story_07_1044_p", "source_sha256": "04d453223c3e6a47d51607d6fdef2dfc847ac2010261668e310eed6d35d56d47", "ja": "（それぞれが胸に抱く寂しさを乗り越えて、貴音も\n海美も、少しだけ前進できた。そんな気がするな……）", "zh": "（她们都克服了各自心中的寂寞，贵音和海美也似乎都向前迈出了一小步……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0112_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0112_story_07_1045_p", "source_sha256": "91339febf63cfca2d29ab1858cb0c32125206cdbe27c4c62055d6c153c14273b", "ja": "（アイドル達の、瞳の中のシリウス……寂しさは、\nそれをより一層輝かせる存在なのかもしれないな）", "zh": "（偶像们眼中的天狼星……寂寞或许正是让它更加闪耀的存在。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
